\f0\b \cf26 \strokec26 Stance Shift
\f2\b0 \cf16 \strokec16 . Switching characters while in 
\f0\b \cf26 \strokec26 Stance Shift
\f2\b0 \cf16 \strokec16  causes Remielle to enter the 
\f0\b \cf26 \strokec26 Phase Flow
\f2\b0 \cf16 \strokec16  state:\cb1 \
\cb24 While in the 
\f0\b \cf26 \strokec26 Phase Flow
\f2\b0 \cf16 \strokec16  state, Remielle acts autonomously to assist in combat. In this state, 
\f0\b \cf26 \strokec26 Floating Radiance
\f2\b0 \cf16 \strokec16  is consumed over time, and some of her attacks apply 
\f0\b \cf25 \strokec25 Lumiflux Buildup
\f2\b0 \cf16 \strokec16  to the target. When 
\f0\b \cf26 \strokec26 Floating Radiance
\f2\b0 \cf16 \strokec16  is fully depleted or upon leaving combat, Remielle exits the 
\f0\b \cf26 \strokec26 Phase Flow
\f2\b0 \cf16 \strokec16  state. Before exiting the 
\f0\b \cf26 \strokec26 Phase Flow
\f2\b0 \cf16 \strokec16  state, Remielle cannot be actively switched in except via a 
\f0\b \cf26 \strokec26 Chain Attack
\f2\b0 \cf16 \strokec16 .\cb1 \
\cb24 If Remielle triggers 3 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://zzz.nanoka.cc/character/1581/#ZzzTerm1000031"}}{\fldrslt \ul Refringe}} reactions in one 
\f0\b \cf26 \strokec26 Phase Flow
\f2\b0 \cf16 \strokec16  state, or has at least 1 stored {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://zzz.nanoka.cc/character/1581/#ZzzTerm1000033"}}{\fldrslt \ul Voidflare}} when 
\f0\b \cf26 \strokec26 Floating Radiance
\f2\b0 \cf16 \strokec16  is fully depleted, 
\f0\b \cf26 \strokec26 Assist: Flower & Feather Dance
\f2\b0 \cf16 \strokec16  becomes available, and her normal switch-in is unlocked. 
\f0\b \cf26 \strokec26 Assist: Flower & Feather Dance
\f2\b0 \cf16 \strokec16  is automatically used on Remielle's next normal switch-in.\cb1 \
\cb24 Upon entering the 
\f0\b \cf26 \strokec26 Phase Flow
\f2\b0 \cf16 \strokec16  state, Remielle increases all squad members's DMG by 
\f0\b \cf27 \strokec27 18.0%
\f2\b0 \cf16 \strokec16  for 60s. Repeated triggers reset the duration.\cb1 \
\cb24 When Remielle's 
\f0\b \cf26 \strokec26 Floating Radiance
\f2\b0 \cf16 \strokec16  has reached its maximum of 120 and her 
\f0\b \cf26 \strokec26 Special Attack
\f2\b0 \cf16 \strokec16  or 
\f0\b \cf26 \strokec26 EX Special Attack
\f2\b0 \cf16 \strokec16  hits a Stunned enemy, she can also enter the 
\f0\b \cf26 \strokec26 Phase Flow
\f2\b0 \cf16 \strokec16  state by switching characters during the 
\f0\b \cf26 \strokec26 Special Attack
\f2\b0 \cf16 \strokec16  or 
\f0\b \cf26 \strokec26 EX Special Attack
\f2\b0 \cf16 \strokec16 .\cb1 \
\cb24 If no character is switched in after entering 
\f0\b \cf26 \strokec26 Stance Shift
\f2\b0 \cf16 \strokec16 , Remielle uses a downward attack to return to the ground instead.\cb1 \
