\fs18 \cf4 \cb31 \strokec4 "We can put an end to evil and split the heavens. We can walk out of the fog and step closer to the truth..."\cb1 \
\cb31 "This is our nation, forever standing tall, and with the power to accomplish miracles."\cb1 \
\cb31 "..."\cb1 \
\cb31 The pink-haired girl finally can't hold it in anymore. Lowering the brim of her hat, she quietly grumbles to the figure at the front of the line:\cb1 \
\cb31 "Beli... This oath is way too long. We're not going to have to recite it all the time, are we?"\cb1 \
\cb31 "Just wait. It'll only get longer."\cb1 \
\cb31 Even the ever-composed figure can't help but smile wryly.\cb1 \
