\fs18 \cf4 \cb31 \strokec4 The girl wrote her name among the Sunseekers, driven by an ideal that burned brighter than the blazing sun.\cb1 \
\cb31 She believed every wound could be healed. She believed every sacrifice could one day come to an end. And so, she turned and walked into the secret garden.\cb1 \
\cb31 She did not yet know that, deep within that garden, time forever diverged, leading to countless futures.\cb1 \
\cb31 Some led to glory. Some led to hope...\cb1 \
\cb31 Others led to the shadow cast by the sun, to a long night that no one would remember.\cb1 \
\cb31 "I know, I know. But someone's gotta do it, right?"\cb1 \
